  "heroContabilTitle": "ACCOUNTING DIVISION",
  "heroContabilMei2027": "MEI rules change in 2027.\nIs your CNPJ ready for the new electronic invoice?",
  "heroContabilLead": "Do not wait for a CNPJ block or retroactive fines. PerfectGest ContabilGest helps MEI and small companies issue NFS-e/NF-e with an operational A1 certificate and keep the cash book on the phone.",
  "heroContabilWhyNowTitle": "Why you need to act now, not in 2027?",
  "heroContabilWhyNowBody": "Enforcement on Individual Microentrepreneurs will be 100% electronic and automated in real time.\nDisorganization will cost you.",
  "heroContabilBulletPix": "--> PIX and card monitoring: The Federal Revenue Service matches everything you receive against the invoices you buy. The numbers must add up.",
  "heroContabilBulletLimit": "--> The cap ghost: If you exceed the MEI ceiling by even R$ 1.00, the tax is charged retroactively with heavy interest.",
  "heroContabilBulletMandatory": "--> General mandate: Issuing NFS-e and NF-e will be the only way to keep your doors open and sell to companies or public bodies.",
  "heroContabilFeaturesTitle": "Everything your CNPJ needs in the palm of your hand",
  "heroContabilFeaturesLead": "A tool to organize the cash book, tax obligations, and invoices on your phone — without replacing official government portals.",
  "heroContabilFeatEmit": "--> NFS-e and NF-e from your phone, with an operational A1 certificate. Basic plan uses your A1; Contabil+ plans use the office homologated flow. The city or SEFAZ authorizes the invoice.",
  "heroContabilFeatThermometer": "--> Obligations and income tax: track deadlines and simulate IR in the app. Official guides and filings remain on government portals.",
  "heroContabilFeatRadar": "--> Purchase invoices: register inbound NFs in the app to match them against outflows at month close.",
  "heroContabilFeatCashbook": "--> Cash book on your phone: record income and expenses for daily use (offline by default). On Contabil+ plans, the responsible accountant reviews and signs the books as contracted.",
  "heroContabilMoreThanApp": "More than an app.",
  "heroContabilPartnerOffice": "An accounting system developed by an accountant.",
  "heroContabilHumanSupport": "There is one responsible accountant and support — not a team of accountants.",
  "heroContabilBulletSupport": "--> Responsible accountant: on Contabil+ plans, reviews the month and signs the books as contracted. On Basic, you operate on your own (self-accounting).",
  "heroContabilBulletGrowth": "--> Company opening and MEI to ME conversion: request it in the app (Basic MEI plan and plans with an accountant). Labor: R$ 490.00 (opening) and R$ 350.00 (conversion). Government fees are extra.",
  "heroContabilNoRisk": "Stop taking risks with the taxman.",
  "heroContabilStartToday": "Start controlling today!",
  "heroContabilAndroid": "--> Available for Android.",
  "heroContabilLgpd": "--> Your data is protected in accordance with the LGPD.",
  "heroContabilPlansIntro": "Get to know our plans and choose the option that fits your business right now:",
  "heroContabilPlanBasicTitle": "Basic Plan (Recommended for MEI):",
  "heroContabilPlanBasicBody": "App + invoice issuance with an A1 certificate (up to 10 invoices/month). Self-accounting: no accountant signature on documents. Full use requires a subscription; official price is at checkout (reference R$ 59.99/month). A1 Quality certificate is a separate offer.",
  "heroContabilPlanActiveTitle": "Contabil+ plan (recommended for ME):",
  "heroContabilPlanActiveBody": "Three bands (Essential, Standard, and Advanced): the responsible accountant reviews and signs the books as contracted. The A1 Quality certificate is not included — it is a separate offer (reference R$ 119.99/year). Official price: the amount shown at checkout.",
